// A changed function rebuilds its machine code, reuses other units, and matches a clean edited executable.
$ gti run -O0 --incremental --codegen-threads 1 --verbose
? 12
stderr: reused 0/8 LLVM code generation units
$ python3 edit.py edit
$ gti run -O0 --incremental --codegen-threads 2 --verbose
? 16
stderr: /8 LLVM code generation units
!stderr: reused 0/8
!stderr: reused 8/8
$ python3 edit.py corrupt
$ gti run -O0 --incremental --codegen-threads 2 --verbose
? 16
stderr: ignored corrupt compiled GTI object
stderr: reused 0/8 LLVM code generation units
$ python3 edit.py save
$ gti run -O0 --incremental --no-cache
? 16
$ python3 edit.py compare
